  "Rivulet has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Rivulet has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.",
  "Rivulet hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Rivulet hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.",
  "Rivulet is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Rivulet is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.",
