  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Hindi pa handa ang torrent stream (tumugon ang engine ng HTTP {status}). Maaaring kumukuha pa ito ng metadata mula sa mga peer.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Hindi ma-install ang update: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Halos hindi kasya rito ang isang pelikula. Magsaksak ng USB drive sa box — naka-format sa FAT32, na tinatanggap ng bawat Android box — at lilitaw ito sa itaas para doon na lang mag-download.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Walang account na malo-log in at walang sinu-sync sa anumang server. Ang pinapanood mo, kung hanggang saan ka na, ang mga paborito mo at ang watchlist mo ay lahat nakaimbak sa device na ito at hindi kailanman umaalis dito. Nakaplano ang pag-sync sa pagitan ng mga screen; hanggang doon, ang backup sa ibaba ang paraan para mailipat ang isang library.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Walang {file} sa iyong documents folder. Kumopya ng isa roon at subukan muli.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Metered ang koneksyong ito sa ngayon.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Hindi metered ang koneksyong ito sa ngayon.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Sumuko ang decoder ng device na ito sa file. Kadalasan ay ang audio ang dahilan: hindi naka-lisensya sa system webview ang Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) at DTS, kaya ang release na may isa sa mga iyon ay lalabas na larawang walang tunog, o hindi lalabas man lang. Mapapatugtog ang x264 release na may AAC audio.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "May isang audio track ang file na ito.",
  "This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This is separate from the performance switch below on purpose. That one turns off blur, which is expensive to draw; the movement here is built out of the two things a graphics chip does almost for free, so a television can usually keep it.",
